\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={210}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{210}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{210}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{210}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304993 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8540635-abef-588a-a946-2176f8e4be45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303493}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a8540635-abef-588a-a946-2176f8e4be45" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303493} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2967536-19df-584e-ab0a-cfd6ff920c58" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304691} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d7c0318b-0316-57b9-b47b-f54289eeab20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303803}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d7c0318b-0316-57b9-b47b-f54289eeab20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303803} :answer-field/id #uuid "e55b054f-88f5-579a-a52a-c8475546eb8f" :answer-