\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{315}^{∘})=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,+$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v={315}^{∘}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-{315}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{315}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{315}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186305044 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d03d3ce4-77de-57f5-afd4-2bf8ad3b1dc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303739}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d03d3ce4-77de-57f5-afd4-2bf8ad3b1dc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303739} :answer-field/id #uuid "51ef8fc9-b283-5905-9e44-87e881dc30ab" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304302} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a3600ad-ef32-5bc6-8dc7-e2e1f54136e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302925}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4a3600ad-ef32-5bc6-8dc7-e2e1f54136e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302925} :answer-